'' A UDT declared inside an 'extern "C++"' block keeps its source spelling, both as a
'' parameter's type and as the OWNER of a member. Measured against fbc's object file.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-mangle tests/mangle/src/cxx-type-case.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: _ZN12DIGITALCLOCKC1EP9FBQWidget
'' EXPECT-OUT: _ZN9FBQObjectC1EPS_
'' EXPECT-OUT: _ZN12FBQLCDNumberC1EP9FBQWidget
'' EXPECT-NOT: FBQWIDGET
'' EXPECT-NOT: FBQLCDNUMBER
'' GOLDEN: expected/cxx-type-case.out
